---
import { HORSE_SPRITE, HORSE_ATLAS_WIDTH, HORSE_ATLAS_HEIGHT, runCycle } from '../../lib/horse-motion';
import { path } from '../../lib/path';
const durationScaleMs = Math.max(...runCycle.map((frame) => frame.durationMs));
---
<figure class="horse-timing-diagram">
  <div class="horse-timing-diagram__frames">
    {runCycle.map((frame, index) => <div class="horse-timing-diagram__frame">
      <svg class="horse-timing-diagram__pose" viewBox={`${frame.atlasX} ${frame.atlasY} ${frame.atlasWidth} ${frame.atlasHeight}`} role="img" aria-label={`${index + 1}つ目の姿勢（素材の${index + 9}コマ目）`}>
        <image href={path(HORSE_SPRITE)} width={HORSE_ATLAS_WIDTH} height={HORSE_ATLAS_HEIGHT} />
      </svg>
      <span>{index + 1} · {frame.durationMs}ms</span>
      <div class="horse-timing-diagram__duration" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="horse-timing-diagram__duration-fill" style={`width: ${(frame.durationMs / durationScaleMs) * 100}%`}></span>
      </div>
    </div>)}
  </div>
  <figcaption>左から素材の9〜12コマ目。下の棒は表示時間の長さを同じ尺度で表しています。</figcaption>
</figure>
<style lang="scss">
  @use "tools" as *;

  .horse-timing-diagram__frames {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-3);

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
  .horse-timing-diagram__frame {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .horse-timing-diagram__pose {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    overflow: hidden;
    @include transparency-checker;
  }
  .horse-timing-diagram__duration {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: rem(4);
    overflow: hidden;
    color: var(--color-text);
    background: var(--color-border);
    border-radius: rem(2);
  }
  .horse-timing-diagram__duration-fill {
    display: block;
    height: 100%;
    background: currentColor;
    border-radius: rem(2);
  }
</style>
